    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      651.01,
      554.89,
      689.38
    ],
    "text": "Fairly heavy falls above 75 mm are likely at some places in Western and Sabaragamuwa provinces and in Kandy, Nuwara-Eliya, Galle and Matara districts.",
