  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      755.92,
      554.96,
      810.1
    ],
    "text": "Strong winds of about (40-50) kmph can be expected at times over Western slopes of the Central hills, Northern, North-central and North-western provinces and in Trincomalee, Monaragala, Hambantota and Matale districts.",
